The web-search agent found information related to the query "prefix caching recomputing prompt multi-step agent workloads time to first token published results measured series". The paper-search agent also found relevant papers on the same topic. However, no specific findings or evidence were provided in the data.

From the data analysis, we have a metric series named "metric_series" with the argument "metric: ttft_ms_baseline". This metric likely represents the time to first token in milliseconds for baseline conditions, which could be used to compare the effectiveness of prefix caching versus recomputing the prompt.

